{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20050",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 3.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 5.17,
      "end_seconds": 10.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I mean, good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.64,
      "end_seconds": 17.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them. Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.56,
      "end_seconds": 28.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "I mean, you know, yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.47,
      "end_seconds": 34.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.66,
      "end_seconds": 43.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Okay, so I've been feeling dizzy, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 45.06,
      "end_seconds": 57.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.07,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Respiratory rate 16, BP is 108 over 80, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.8 degrees, pulse is 76 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.85,
      "end_seconds": 58.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.38,
      "end_seconds": 69.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.62,
      "end_seconds": 78.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "Okay, so I'd say three weeks. Actually, no, closer to one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.05,
      "end_seconds": 85.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 85.1,
      "end_seconds": 91.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.18,
      "end_seconds": 99.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on. Has there been a sore neck too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.58,
      "end_seconds": 106.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Mm, yes. About sore neck, it's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.61,
      "end_seconds": 117.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any double vision, clear fluid from the nose or ear or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.51,
      "end_seconds": 136.89,
      "duration_seconds": 19.38,
      "text": "Erm, no, no double vision, no clear fluid from the nose or ear, no weakness. I did have a bump on my head at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.94,
      "end_seconds": 142.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Have you had any confusion or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.91,
      "end_seconds": 145.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.62,
      "end_seconds": 150.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.64,
      "end_seconds": 156.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Ah, um, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.01,
      "end_seconds": 160.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.17,
      "end_seconds": 167.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Right, um, just an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.99,
      "end_seconds": 171.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.04,
      "end_seconds": 181.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol. Sorry, what was I saying, my mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.08,
      "end_seconds": 188.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.9,
      "end_seconds": 197.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Erm, I've had high blood pressure, yes. I, I have epilepsy, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.83,
      "end_seconds": 205.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure and epilepsy in your file as well. Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.93,
      "end_seconds": 209.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.09,
      "end_seconds": 211.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.21,
      "end_seconds": 219.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.54,
      "end_seconds": 222.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.11,
      "end_seconds": 226.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.06,
      "end_seconds": 244.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.52,
      "end_seconds": 253.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Oh, um, I'm on sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.55,
      "end_seconds": 258.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "So, is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.05,
      "end_seconds": 262.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.23,
      "end_seconds": 269.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.26,
      "end_seconds": 273.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.5,
      "end_seconds": 276.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Okay, look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "There is a small bruise on the forehead, the pupils are equal and reactive, and you are walking steadily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.45,
      "end_seconds": 332.24,
      "duration_seconds": 29.79,
      "text": "You can relax now. Having listened and examined, it fits best with a minor head injury without worrying signs. Another possibility is a concussion. I can't rule out a neck strain yet. I'm prescribing paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. It's for headache. Someone should stay with you tonight, and no alcohol or contact sport for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.23,
      "end_seconds": 347.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.55,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'll want another look if the headache gets worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 349.16,
      "end_seconds": 354.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.3,
      "end_seconds": 357.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.93,
      "end_seconds": 362.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.03,
      "end_seconds": 367.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}